  {
   "id": "ROOMES20:13b3d",
   "off": 80701,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「カリフォスが\r  消えちまったらしい\u0010\b  後には 大きな穴が\r  あるだけだったそうだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Word is Caliphos just up and vanished.\u0010\bAll that's left, they say, is a great big hole.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES20:13b93",
   "off": 80787,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「ずっと 新国王の姿が\r  見えないんだ\u0010\b  城では 魔導聖堂が\r  軍の指揮権まで\r  握っている」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Nobody's seen the new King for ages.\u0010\bOver at the castle, the Temple of Sorcery's even taken command of the army.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
